["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Advice Line with Michelle Wahler of Beyond Yoga cohort second first impression under promise and over deliver\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-howibuilt-创始人最该学的不是融资-是学会说不/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aedd4aae43a50f3c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">41:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>创始人最该学的不是融资，是学会说不</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Beyond Yoga 创始人 Michelle Wahler 说，创业不必融资、不必规划退出，把生意做成可持续的就好；她丈夫当年拦住她做泳衣，逼她先把一条瑜伽裤做到最好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创业建议</span><span class=\"tag\">融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Forced vacations are a fraud control float Schelling point five nines chaos monkey\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-complexsys-银行放假不是效率低-是反内部欺诈的控制手段/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9506e20ee39946a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">28:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>银行放假不是效率低，是反内部欺诈的控制手段</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">金融系统周末和假日停摆，看起来像技术落后，其实是一种刻意设计的控制：让同谋者无法同时坐在键盘前，从而暴露内部欺诈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">金融基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">运营风险</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Strait talk: Why the oil crisis is getting worse Strait of Bab-el-Mandeb Barim Island Schrodinger Strait choke point\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-indicator-胡塞武装掐住第二个海峡-油价破百只是开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">8:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Indicator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>胡塞武装掐住第二个海峡，油价破百只是开始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">红海航运量已从峰值腰斩且从未恢复，如今胡塞武装拿下曼德海峡中的丕林岛，沙特绕开霍尔木兹的替代出口路线也悬了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地缘政治</span><span class=\"tag\">油价</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"From Voice Agents to AI Avatars with Alexander Smola - #777 Proactbench Ibench back channeling millennial sandwich theory of the mind\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-twiml-语音-ai-的瓶颈不是模型-是-150-毫秒的生物学约束/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/12967175c59e351e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TWIML AI</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>语音 AI 的瓶颈不是模型，是 150 毫秒的生物学约束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人类视听感知只有 6-10 赫兹，模型必须在这个时间窗内被打断；而高保真音频意味着每秒更多 token，token 越多参数就得越小——这是语音 AI 绕不开的物理取舍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">语音AI</span><span class=\"tag\">多模态</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Ice Age America: The Clovis Culture Clovis points fluting ZooMS ochre hearth-centered areas overkill debate\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-ancients-克洛维斯人不是只会猎猛犸-他们还在帐篷里画画缝衣/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/baa588ecfd782397-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">57:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>克洛维斯人不是只会猎猛犸，他们还在帐篷里画画缝衣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">怀俄明LaPrele遗址挖出四个火塘中心区、赭石颜料和骨针，DNA蛋白质分析显示针是用红狐和猫科动物的骨头做的——克洛维斯人的食谱远比「猛犸猎人」这个标签复杂。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古</span><span class=\"tag\">冰期</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"#502 – Psychiatry, Insane Asylums, Mental Illness, ECT, Lobotomies, Freud &amp; Jung serendipitous event shell game without a P lobotomobile diagnostic creep tardive dyskinesia CATIE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-lex-精神病学两百年的教训-没有青霉素-只有试错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d67cbc9ec26fc241-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">3:25:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Lex Fridman</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>精神病学两百年的教训：没有青霉素，只有试错</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">从冰锥额叶切除术到胰岛素昏迷，精神病学反复宣称 80% 治愈率，却始终没有一种精神科的青霉素——今天最好的药，仍有八成患者中途退出试验。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">精神病学</span><span class=\"tag\">医学史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Knights vs Ottomans: The Great Siege of Malta Traccia Italiana scorched earth Grand Master corsair\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-historyhit-奥斯曼四万大军围攻马耳他-为何败给几百骑士/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9f68700f4e1f904-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">28:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>奥斯曼四万大军围攻马耳他，为何败给几百骑士</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1565 年奥斯曼舰队 180 艘船、四万人围攻马耳他，守军只有约 500 名骑士和几千马耳他人。圣埃尔莫堡硬撑一个月后陷落，但拖到九月西西里援军登陆，奥斯曼人撤退。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">历史</span><span class=\"tag\">军事</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"706. Queen Victoria’s Revenge: Storming the Citadel (Part 2) Maria Theresa thaler Snider breech-loading rifle khaki Ferenjis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-restishistory-英国远征埃塞俄比亚-一场用铁路和大象打赢的人质危机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d9d0cedd270ca9a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>英国远征埃塞俄比亚：一场用铁路和大象打赢的人质危机</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1868年英国为救几十名人质，花掉一千万英镑、运去44头大象和20英里铁轨，用后膛枪对长矛打出一场屠杀——然后立刻撤走，留下埃塞俄比亚二十年内战。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">帝国史</span><span class=\"tag\">人质危机</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.275 澳洲保健品是怎么火起来的? TGA AUSTL AUSTR GMP CMO / CDMO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-bizthisway-澳洲保健品监管像药-但没人管它有没有效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fd1ebf29b7a3afa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">39:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">商业就是这样</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>澳洲保健品监管像药，但没人管它有没有效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">澳洲把保健品和药品放在同一个机构下监管，看上去很严格；但功效既不在上市前审查，也不在生产环节被检验——「好」的印象是被营销和跨境政策植入的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">保健品</span><span class=\"tag\">监管套利</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"396. Stalin: The Bolshevik Revolution (Part 2) Cheka political commissar General Secretary White Russians\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-empirehist-列宁设计了恐怖机器-斯大林只是接手了它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">44:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>列宁设计了恐怖机器，斯大林只是接手了它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">秘密警察、劳改营、一党制都是列宁留下的架构，斯大林做的是把它变成个人权力工具——他当总书记后第一件事就是往关键岗位塞自己人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">苏联史</span><span class=\"tag\">斯大林</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why You Don&#x27;t Need a Co-Founder to Start | Dave Morin, Offline Ventures Company OS idea maze agentic engineering\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-solofounders-单人创始人不是一个人-关系才是产品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2a0f466f68788060-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">58:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>单人创始人不是一个人：关系才是产品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">85% 的创业公司死于关系没成，不是产品想法差。单人创始人的真正含义是当个独奏艺术家，把找关系当成主业，而不是真的一个人扛。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">单人创业</span><span class=\"tag\">创始人关系</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Underwriting Superintelligence: Backing Agents you can Sue — Rune Kvist, AIUC AIUC-1 eval awareness groundedness filter lemon problem CAISI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-latentspace-ai-落地的瓶颈不是能力-是没人敢签字担责/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6979f3df4fdf5281-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>AI 落地的瓶颈不是能力，是没人敢签字担责</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Waymo 四年前就比人开得好，却至今进不了机场——约束 AI 有用性的从来不是能力，而是责任、风险和信任。AIUC 想用标准加保险补上这块信心基础设施。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 合规</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 保险</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Transplanted human brain-tissue takes root in mice without a cortex organoid pallium xenocortical mice paper to agent AlphaGenome\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-naturepod-人脑类器官移植进小鼠-长出了四百万人类神经元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">28:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>人脑类器官移植进小鼠，长出了四百万人类神经元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小鼠被基因手段删掉几乎整个皮层，植入人脑类器官后长出约400万人类神经元，行为既不像正常鼠也不像无皮层鼠，而是第三种状态。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神经科学</span><span class=\"tag\">类器官</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Beyond the Hype: Dr. Xiao Liu on Evaluating Medical AI Delphi study CONSORT SPIRIT white dot syndromes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-nejmaigrandrou-ai-评估的混乱不是技术问题-是透明度问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ff7071d8628d0546-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">43:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">NEJM AI Grand Rounds</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>AI 评估的混乱不是技术问题，是透明度问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2019 年那篇系统综述里，只有不到 5% 的医学影像 AI 论文达到了其他医学领域早已确立的严谨标准，而表现最好的模型也只是与放射科医生持平。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">临床验证</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Coley&#x27;s Toxins and the Origins of Immunotherapy erysipelas Bacillus prodigiosus BCG tumor necrosis factor (TNF)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-stuffmissed-他用细菌毒素治癌症-被同行骂了四十年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">38:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>他用细菌毒素治癌症，被同行骂了四十年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Coley 用链球菌毒素让部分肉瘤患者肿瘤消失，但无法标准化、无法解释机制，最终被放疗和监管挤出局；他的女儿用后半生为这套疗法建起了癌症研究所。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医学史</span><span class=\"tag\">癌症免疫治疗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Ron Rothblum on Fiat-Shamir Attacks, Flock and SNARK.fast Fiat-Shamir GKR diagonalization polynomial commitment scheme sketched code binary fields\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-zeroknowledge-fiat-shamir-攻击不是误用-是协议本身不安全/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7dca63fe71cd70d3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Z\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Zero Knowledge</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>Fiat-Shamir 攻击不是误用，是协议本身不安全</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">GKR 这类真实部署的协议，在标准 Fiat-Shamir 下可被证明假命题为真；这不是实现疏忽，是变换本身的问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零知识证明</span><span class=\"tag\">Fiat-Shamir</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Annie Lowrey on the Time Tax, Fraud, and Rationing by Paperwork time tax TANF submerged benefits Jevons paradox improper payment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-tyler-政府不只浪费你的钱-还浪费你每周一小时/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0fc39ddaf6ffc3b9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">56:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>政府不只浪费你的钱，还浪费你每周一小时</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国人不自己报税的国家有一堆，IRS 却被法律禁止替你做。时间税最狠的不是富人，是穷人、移民和进过监狱的人——而 AI 未必救得了他们。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共政策</span><span class=\"tag\">行政负担</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The AI-Native CRM business world model greenfield / brownfield schema hopium ICP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-a16z-tome-做到-2500-万用户后-他推倒重来去做-crm/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>Tome 做到 2500 万用户后，他推倒重来去做 CRM</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Keith Perez 放弃 2500 万用户的 Tome，因为团队自己都不喜欢那个产品；他判断 CRM 的胜负手不是让销售多干活，而是能不能把公司的客户现实完整建模。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>16</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CRM</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 原生应用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Are bad teeth the number one reason kids go to A&amp;E? NEET P-Doom dentine\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-moreorless-儿童看急诊第一原因是牙-数字被念错了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/475b54e7ecf452a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">28:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">More or Less</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>儿童看急诊第一原因是牙？数字被念错了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英国议员说牙齿问题是儿童进急诊的第一原因，实际数字指的是5到18岁因蛀牙住院治疗——两者不是一回事，而蛀牙率其实在缓慢下降。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">事实核查</span><span class=\"tag\">公共卫生</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Michael Moritz - Lessons From 40 Years of Investing and Writing - [Invest Like the Best, EP.491] bolt hole monomania collabos great man theory Fleet Street\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-ilt-红杉前掌门看人-14-岁前发生了什么-内核就定了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/099b44b457a7da61-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>红杉前掌门看人：14 岁前发生了什么，内核就定了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他挖自己难民家族的历史后发现，一个人 12、13、14 岁前从父母身上无意识吸收的印记会跟你一辈子；之后变的是外在强度，不是内核。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">早期投资</span><span class=\"tag\">红杉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Extreme Meteorology (EL NIÑO) with Marshall Shepherd ENSO teleconnection atmospheric rivers jet stream warm blob\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-ologies-最强厄尔尼诺还没到峰值-但没人活着见过它这么大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>最强厄尔尼诺还没到峰值，但没人活着见过它这么大</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2026 年的厄尔尼诺在秋季就已超过 1982 和 2015 两次历史最强事件的峰值，而它的峰值通常在冬季才到。这不是未来的气候预测，是正在发生的天气。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">气候</span><span class=\"tag\">厄尔尼诺</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How investing is getting riskier (Two Indicators) margin trading margin call single-stock leveraged ETF prediction market\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-planetmoney-保证金债务创纪录-散户正在用借来的钱炒股/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">18:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Planet Money</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>保证金债务创纪录，散户正在用借来的钱炒股</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国券商保证金债务已超过全美信用卡债务总额，韩国杠杆 ETF 崩盘让 36 万个账户被强制清仓，其中多数是 35 岁以下的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">保证金交易</span><span class=\"tag\">杠杆ETF</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Ep. 031 - EMERGENCY EPISODE: Are We Doomed? | Jordan Nanos, Doug O&#x27;Laughlin, Max Kan, Joey Brookhart neocloud backwardation P Doom RSI ROSA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-semianalysiswe-安全不是减速带-anthropic-的合规承诺反而要吃掉更多算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d3f66fbf6cfa27e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">SemiAnalysis Weekly</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>安全不是减速带：Anthropic 的合规承诺反而要吃掉更多算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dario 的「pacing the frontier」被读成要少买卡，但 OpenAI 光思维链监控就花掉 20% 的算力——安全本身是算力密集型产业，需求继续跑赢供给。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"88.在新加坡，与祥峰郑俊聪的访谈：硬科技，下一代 Long China 与华人创新的信心史 golden share DPI Singapore Washing eVTOL AI for Science\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-lightstar-投中宇树却错过加注-耐心资本也会被基金周期卡住/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ccc5fa65423d3ede-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"卫\"><span class=\"dur\">2:29:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">漫谈Light the Star</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>投中宇树却错过加注：耐心资本也会被基金周期卡住</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">祥峰2020年是宇树Pre-A+轮唯一机构投资人，2023年那轮却因自家美元基金到期、正在募新基金而没钱跟投。重仓追投考验的不只是眼光，还有基金和项目的节奏匹配。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬科技投资</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>"]